rowser execution in the future verification goal only. This benchmark run records the browser story and cache but does not start a browser, server, driver, or HTML test tooling.\\\"\n\\\"\"'$U\" --description-section \"$PLAN\" scope '\"\\\\\n  -p 5.1: \\\"In scope: future creation of button-chain.html, the initial button DOM, generated-button append behavior, terminal finished state, visible white border styling, static inspection, direct browser story, and bug feedback loop instructions.\\\" \\\\\n  -p 5.2: \\\"Out of scope for this planning-only proof: creating or editing button-chain.html now, opening or inspecting any HTML now, serving files, launching browser automation, changing repository code, or auditing outside the isolated benchmark workspace and tagged source paths.\\\"\n\\\"\"'$U\" --description-section \"$PLAN\" affected-areas '\"\\\\\n  -p 6.1: \\\"Future affected implementation file: button-chain.html. Planned scopes inside that file are document body markup, button-chain script click handler, and .completion-message styling.\\\" \\\\\n  -p 6.2: \\\"Plan-only artifacts are contained in this plan directory. No application source, dependency, service, database, or runtime process is affected by this proof run.\\\"\n\\\"\"'$U\" --description-section \"$PLAN\" constraints-and-decisions '\"\\\\\n  -p 7.1: \\\"Use only the tagged repository-local planning skill and its relative references under /tmp/ai-skills-capsules/20260811T053701Z-pilot-142-matrix-iterative/1.4.1/worker/planning/. The installed planning skill is intentionally not read or used.\\\" \\\\\n  -p 7.2: \\\"The requested plan directory name contains dots, while create-plan.sh accepts only kebab-case. The helper-generated skeleton was created with a temporary kebab-case name and moved intact to the exact benchmark-required directory; this is recorded as a process decision.\\\" \\\\\n  -p 7.3: \\\"Normal runner behavior is preserved: parallelism and subagents are not disabled, ephemeral mode is