cution, inspect the workspace file list and button-chain.html source without running it. Confirm button-chain.html is the only newly created HTML artifact for the future task.\" -p 5.2: \"Read the file source and verify one initial source button, generated-button logic, exact lowercase finished text, and a white visible border style for .completion-message.\"\n\"$U\" --step-section \"$PLAN\" 02-verify-button-chain-behavior/01-step-static-inspection acceptance-criteria -p 6.1: \"Inspection evidence records that button-chain.html exists and no extra .html or .htm task artifacts were created.\" -p 6.2: \"Inspection evidence records exact lowercase finished and a white border style in the source contract.\" -p 6.3: \"If inspection fails, mark the step failed and enter the bug feedback loop before browser validation.\"\n\"$U\" --step-paragraph \"$PLAN\" 02-verify-button-chain-behavior/01-step-static-inspection 7.1 \"W05 may proceed only when the static contract is satisfied or a resolved bug has been retested.\"\n\"$U\" --step-section \"$PLAN\" 02-verify-button-chain-behavior/02-step-browser-story instructions -p 5.1: \"Open the implemented button-chain.html in a browser from a fresh state. Run ui-story-runs/US-01.md exactly: click the rendered current last button four times, choosing the bottom-most visible button after each append.\" -p 5.2: \"Record visible evidence after each click. Do not use console commands, JavaScript evaluation, storage edits, direct API calls, or injected events to create the passing state.\" -p 5.3: \"After the terminal click, confirm only finished remains visible and that the finished text has a visible white border. Update ui-user-stories.md, ui-story-runs/US-01.md, and bugs.md with the result.\"\n\"$U\" --step-section \"$PLAN\" 02-verify-button-chain-behavior/02-step-browser-story acceptance-criteria -p 6.1: \"US-01 is marked passed only after browser evidence shows one button added per first three clicks and the fourth generated button ter